ground_truth:
Use YAMLDoc.setRootAsMap() (equivalent to YAMLDoc.root.value = new MappingNode();) to set the document's root node to a mapping node. Then retrieve the root with YAMLDoc.getRoot() and call appendNode(node) on its .value to add key-value pairs into the mapping, e.g.: ```YAMLDoc.setRootAsMap(); 
var root = YAMLDoc.getRoot();
root.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("country", "England"));
 root.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("resident", true));``` Note: the official documentation shows the setRootAsMap()/root.value = new MappingNode() syntax in a separate section ("How do I set the root node of a YAML document?"), but its one full worked "create from scratch" example uses setRootAsList() as the root instead, with mapping nodes only appended as children further down. So the mapping-root pattern itself is documented, but there is no single full end-to-end example combining a mapping root with appendNode the way the list-root example does.

The root node is a mapping node - a single top-level key ("book") mapping to nested key-value pairs, not a list. Use YAMLDoc.setRootAsMap() to set the document's root to a mapping node, retrieve it with YAMLDoc.getRoot(), create a nested "book" MappingNode, populate it with ScalarNode entries via .value.appendNode(), then append "book" into the document root's .value, e.g.: ```YAMLDoc.setRootAsMap();
var root = YAMLDoc.getRoot();
var bookNode = new MappingNode("book");
bookNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("title", "The Quiet Harbour"));
bookNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("author", "Elena Marsh"));
bookNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("yearPublished", 2019));
root.value.appendNode(bookNode);```

The root node is a mapping node - the document has a single top-level key ("students") whose value is a list of mapping entries, so the root itself is a map, not a list. Use YAMLDoc.setRootAsMap(), retrieve the root with YAMLDoc.getRoot(), create a ListNode named "students" sized to the number of entries, and populate each row directly with appendNode() - rows created via the ListNode constructor act as anonymous mapping entries, so no .value is needed on the row itself - then append the "students" ListNode into the document root's .value, e.g.: ```YAMLDoc.setRootAsMap();
var root = YAMLDoc.getRoot();
var studentsNode = new ListNode("students", 4);
studentsNode.value.at(0).appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "S001"));
studentsNode.value.at(0).appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Grace Adeyemi"));
studentsNode.value.at(0).appendNode(new ScalarNode("grade", "A"));
studentsNode.value.at(1).appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "S002"));
studentsNode.value.at(1).appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Tom Fielding"));
studentsNode.value.at(1).appendNode(new ScalarNode("grade", "B"));
studentsNode.value.at(2).appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "S003"));
studentsNode.value.at(2).appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Priya Nair"));
studentsNode.value.at(2).appendNode(new ScalarNode("grade", "A-"));
studentsNode.value.at(3).appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "S004"));
studentsNode.value.at(3).appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Ollie Bennett"));
studentsNode.value.at(3).appendNode(new ScalarNode("grade", "C+"));
root.value.appendNode(studentsNode);```

The root node is a mapping node - the top level has two sibling keys, "fleetSummary" and "vehicles", so the document root is a map (the list only appears one level down, as the value of "vehicles"). Use YAMLDoc.setRootAsMap(), build "fleetSummary" as a MappingNode of scalars, and build "vehicles" as a ListNode of 4 mapping entries, populated with appendNode() directly on each row. VH-001 is shown fully below; the same pattern applies to vehiclesNode.value.at(1) through at(3), with three differences to reproduce faithfully: VH-004's "location" is null (use new ScalarNode("location", null) instead of a nested MappingNode), VH-002 and VH-004 have an empty maintenanceHistory (use new ListNode("maintenanceHistory", 0) with no rows to populate), and VH-004 is electric so its sensorReadings uses "batteryStateOfHealthPct"/"batteryVoltage" instead of "oilPressureBar"/"coolantTempC". Example: ```YAMLDoc.setRootAsMap();
var root = YAMLDoc.getRoot();

var fleetSummaryNode = new MappingNode("fleetSummary");
fleetSummaryNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("totalVehicles", 4));
fleetSummaryNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("activeVehicles", 3));
fleetSummaryNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("totalMileageKm", 184320));
fleetSummaryNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("avgFuelEfficiencyKmpl", 12.4));
fleetSummaryNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("maintenanceDueCount", 1));
root.value.appendNode(fleetSummaryNode);

var vehiclesNode = new ListNode("vehicles", 4);
var v1 = vehiclesNode.value.at(0);
v1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("vehicleId", "VH-001"));
v1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("make", "Ford"));
v1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("model", "Transit Custom"));
v1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("registration", "LN19 XKP"));
var v1Location = new MappingNode("location");
v1Location.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("lat", 53.4808));
v1Location.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("lon", -2.2426));
v1.appendNode(v1Location);
var v1Engine = new MappingNode("engine");
v1Engine.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("type", "diesel"));
var v1Diagnostics = new MappingNode("diagnostics");
v1Diagnostics.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("lastCheckedAt", "2024-06-01T08:00:00Z"));
var v1Sensors = new MappingNode("sensorReadings");
v1Sensors.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("oilPressureBar", 3.2));
v1Sensors.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("coolantTempC", 89));
v1Sensors.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("batteryVoltage", 12.6));
v1Diagnostics.value.appendNode(v1Sensors);
v1Engine.value.appendNode(v1Diagnostics);
v1.appendNode(v1Engine);
var v1History = new ListNode("maintenanceHistory", 2);
v1History.value.at(0).appendNode(new ScalarNode("date", "2024-01-15"));
v1History.value.at(0).appendNode(new ScalarNode("type", "oil_change"));
v1History.value.at(0).appendNode(new ScalarNode("mileageKm", 42100));
v1History.value.at(1).appendNode(new ScalarNode("date", "2024-04-20"));
v1History.value.at(1).appendNode(new ScalarNode("type", "brake_inspection"));
v1History.value.at(1).appendNode(new ScalarNode("mileageKm", 47850));
v1.appendNode(v1History);
v1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("status", "active"));

root.value.appendNode(vehiclesNode);```

The root node is a list node - the document is a top-level sequence of two order records, not a single mapping. Use YAMLDoc.setRootAsList(), call root.value.addRows(2) to create the two order rows, then populate each row directly with appendNode() (each row is an anonymous mapping entry). Order 1 (ORD-20240613-88421) is built fully below on order1 = root.value.at(0); order2 = root.value.at(1) follows the identical nested appendNode pattern, with these differences to reproduce faithfully: customer.tier is "platinum" with different loyaltyPoints values; shipping.address has no "line2" key at all (simply omit that appendNode call rather than using null); billing.sameAsShipping is true and billing.address duplicates the shipping address; all 3 items have a non-null "discount" mapping (no ScalarNode(..., null) needed); and payment.method is "paypal", with card.last4 "0000", card.brand "PayPal", and card.expiresAt null (use new ScalarNode("expiresAt", null)). Example: ```YAMLDoc.setRootAsList();
var root = YAMLDoc.getRoot();
root.value.addRows(2);
var order1 = root.value.at(0);

order1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("orderId", "ORD-20240613-88421"));
order1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("placedAt", "2024-06-13T09:15:00Z"));
order1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("status", "partially_shipped"));

var customer1 = new MappingNode("customer");
customer1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "CUST-4421"));
customer1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Sophie Marchand"));
customer1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("email", "sophie.marchand@email.com"));
customer1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("tier", "gold"));
var loyalty1 = new MappingNode("loyaltyPoints");
loyalty1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("balance", 3420));
loyalty1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("earned_this_order", 85));
customer1.value.appendNode(loyalty1);
order1.appendNode(customer1);

var shipping1 = new MappingNode("shipping");
var shipAddr1 = new MappingNode("address");
shipAddr1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("line1", "14 Rue de Rivoli"));
shipAddr1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("line2", "Apt 3B"));
shipAddr1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("city", "Paris"));
shipAddr1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("postcode", "75001"));
shipAddr1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("country", "FR"));
shipping1.value.appendNode(shipAddr1);
shipping1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("method", "express_48h"));
shipping1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("estimatedDelivery", "2024-06-15"));
var tracking1 = new ListNode("tracking", 2);
tracking1.value.at(0).appendNode(new ScalarNode("parcelId", "PKG-001"));
tracking1.value.at(0).appendNode(new ScalarNode("carrier", "DHL"));
tracking1.value.at(0).appendNode(new ScalarNode("status", "in_transit"));
var items1a = new ListNode("items", 2);
items1a.value = Sequence{"SKU-992", "SKU-993"};
tracking1.value.at(0).appendNode(items1a);
tracking1.value.at(1).appendNode(new ScalarNode("parcelId", "PKG-002"));
tracking1.value.at(1).appendNode(new ScalarNode("carrier", "Colissimo"));
tracking1.value.at(1).appendNode(new ScalarNode("status", "preparing"));
var items1b = new ListNode("items", 1);
items1b.value = Sequence{"SKU-1041"};
tracking1.value.at(1).appendNode(items1b);
shipping1.value.appendNode(tracking1);
order1.appendNode(shipping1);

var billing1 = new MappingNode("billing");
billing1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("sameAsShipping", false));
var billAddr1 = new MappingNode("address");
billAddr1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("line1", "7 Boulevard Haussmann"));
billAddr1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("city", "Paris"));
billAddr1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("postcode", "75009"));
billAddr1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("country", "FR"));
billing1.value.appendNode(billAddr1);
order1.appendNode(billing1);

var orderItems1 = new ListNode("items", 3);
var it1 = orderItems1.value.at(0);
it1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("sku", "SKU-992"));
it1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Wireless Noise-Cancelling Headphones"));
it1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("qty", 1));
it1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("unitPrice", 189.99));
var disc1 = new MappingNode("discount");
disc1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("type", "percentage"));
disc1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("value", 10));
it1.appendNode(disc1);
it1.appendNode(new ScalarNode("finalPrice", 170.99));
var it2 = orderItems1.value.at(1);
it2.appendNode(new ScalarNode("sku", "SKU-993"));
it2.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "USB-C Charging Cable (2m)"));
it2.appendNode(new ScalarNode("qty", 3));
it2.appendNode(new ScalarNode("unitPrice", 12.50));
it2.appendNode(new ScalarNode("discount", null));
it2.appendNode(new ScalarNode("finalPrice", 37.50));
var it3 = orderItems1.value.at(2);
it3.appendNode(new ScalarNode("sku", "SKU-1041"));
it3.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Laptop Stand (Aluminium)"));
it3.appendNode(new ScalarNode("qty", 1));
it3.appendNode(new ScalarNode("unitPrice", 54.00));
var disc3 = new MappingNode("discount");
disc3.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("type", "fixed"));
disc3.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("value", 5.00));
it3.appendNode(disc3);
it3.appendNode(new ScalarNode("finalPrice", 49.00));
order1.appendNode(orderItems1);

var payment1 = new MappingNode("payment");
payment1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("method", "card"));
var card1 = new MappingNode("card");
card1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("last4", "7823"));
card1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("brand", "Visa"));
card1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("expiresAt", "2026-09"));
payment1.value.appendNode(card1);
var breakdown1 = new MappingNode("breakdown");
breakdown1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("subtotal", 257.49));
breakdown1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("shipping", 4.99));
breakdown1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("tax", 25.75));
breakdown1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("loyaltyDiscount", -17.10));
breakdown1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("total", 271.13));
payment1.value.appendNode(breakdown1);
payment1.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("status", "captured"));
order1.appendNode(payment1);```

The root node is a list node containing a single entry (the top level starts with "- restaurant:"), and that one entry is a mapping with five top-level keys: "restaurant", "allergens", "dietaryIcons", "menu", and "drinks". Use YAMLDoc.setRootAsList(), call root.value.addRows(1) for the single row, then build each of the five keys with appendNode() directly on that row. Key patterns demonstrated: "restaurant" is a MappingNode of scalars plus a nested "openingHours" MappingNode; "allergens" is a ListNode of plain scalar strings set via .value = Sequence{...}; "dietaryIcons" is a MappingNode whose entries are all scalar key-value pairs (icon code to label); "menu" contains a "sections" ListNode of mapping entries, each with an "id", "name", nested "nameLocal" MappingNode, and an "items" ListNode of mapping entries (item IT-102 shows portionSize as explicitly null); and "drinks" contains a "nonAlcoholic" ListNode and a nested "wine" MappingNode holding "byGlass" and "byBottle" ListNodes. Section S01 (Small Plates) is fully built below; sections S02 (Mains) and S03 (Desserts) follow the identical id/name/nameLocal/items pattern, populated at sectionsNode.value.at(1) and at(2), with two additional structures appearing inside S02's items (e.g. IT-201 Massaman Lamb Shank): a "modifierGroups" ListNode of mapping entries (each with "name", a "required" boolean, and an "options" ListNode of mapping entries with "label" and "priceDelta", built with the exact same nested ListNode/appendNode pattern shown for "items"), and an empty "allergens" list on Mango Sticky Rice (IT-302), built as new ListNode("allergens", 0) with no rows to populate. Example: ```YAMLDoc.setRootAsList();
var root = YAMLDoc.getRoot();
root.value.addRows(1);
var row = root.value.at(0);

var restaurantNode = new MappingNode("restaurant");
restaurantNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "REST-00221"));
restaurantNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Ember & Spice"));
restaurantNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("cuisine", "Modern Southeast Asian Fusion"));
restaurantNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("priceRange", "££££"));
restaurantNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("currency", "GBP"));
restaurantNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("address", "12 Charlotte Street, London, W1T 2NE"));
var openingHours = new MappingNode("openingHours");
openingHours.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("Mon", "closed"));
openingHours.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("Tue-Thu", "12:00-15:00, 18:00-22:30"));
openingHours.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("Fri-Sat", "12:00-15:30, 18:00-23:00"));
openingHours.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("Sun", "13:00-21:00"));
restaurantNode.value.appendNode(openingHours);
restaurantNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("serviceCharge", 0.125));
row.appendNode(restaurantNode);

var allergensNode = new ListNode("allergens", 14);
allergensNode.value = Sequence{"gluten", "crustaceans", "eggs", "fish", "peanuts", "soya", "milk", "nuts", "celery", "mustard", "sesame", "sulphites", "lupin", "molluscs"};
row.appendNode(allergensNode);

var dietaryIconsNode = new MappingNode("dietaryIcons");
dietaryIconsNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("VG", "Vegan"));
dietaryIconsNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("V", "Vegetarian"));
dietaryIconsNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("GF", "Gluten-Free"));
dietaryIconsNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("DF", "Dairy-Free"));
dietaryIconsNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("H", "Halal"));
dietaryIconsNode.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("N", "Contains Nuts"));
row.appendNode(dietaryIconsNode);

var menuNode = new MappingNode("menu");
var sectionsNode = new ListNode("sections", 3);
var s01 = sectionsNode.value.at(0);
s01.appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "S01"));
s01.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Small Plates"));
var s01Local = new MappingNode("nameLocal");
s01Local.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("th", "อาหารจานเล็ก"));
s01Local.value.appendNode(new ScalarNode("zh", "小食"));
s01.appendNode(s01Local);
var s01Items = new ListNode("items", 3);
var it101 = s01Items.value.at(0);
it101.appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "IT-101"));
it101.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Betel Leaf Bites"));
it101.appendNode(new ScalarNode("description", "Wild betel leaf, tiger prawn, toasted coconut, lime, birds eye chilli"));
it101.appendNode(new ScalarNode("price", 12.50));
var it101Dietary = new ListNode("dietary", 2);
it101Dietary.value = Sequence{"GF", "DF"};
it101.appendNode(it101Dietary);
var it101Allergens = new ListNode("allergens", 2);
it101Allergens.value = Sequence{"crustaceans", "fish"};
it101.appendNode(it101Allergens);
it101.appendNode(new ScalarNode("popular", true));
it101.appendNode(new ScalarNode("portionSize", "4 pieces"));
var it102 = s01Items.value.at(1);
it102.appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "IT-102"));
it102.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Smoked Duck Salad"));
it102.appendNode(new ScalarNode("description", "Confit duck, green mango, shallot, mint, tamarind dressing, crushed peanuts"));
it102.appendNode(new ScalarNode("price", 14.00));
var it102Dietary = new ListNode("dietary", 2);
it102Dietary.value = Sequence{"GF", "DF"};
it102.appendNode(it102Dietary);
var it102Allergens = new ListNode("allergens", 3);
it102Allergens.value = Sequence{"peanuts", "sesame", "fish"};
it102.appendNode(it102Allergens);
it102.appendNode(new ScalarNode("popular", false));
it102.appendNode(new ScalarNode("portionSize", null));
var it103 = s01Items.value.at(2);
it103.appendNode(new ScalarNode("id", "IT-103"));
it103.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Crispy Tofu Skewers"));
it103.appendNode(new ScalarNode("description", "Silken tofu, satay glaze, cucumber relish, sesame"));
it103.appendNode(new ScalarNode("price", 9.50));
var it103Dietary = new ListNode("dietary", 2);
it103Dietary.value = Sequence{"VG", "GF"};
it103.appendNode(it103Dietary);
var it103Allergens = new ListNode("allergens", 3);
it103Allergens.value = Sequence{"soya", "peanuts", "sesame"};
it103.appendNode(it103Allergens);
s01.appendNode(s01Items);
menuNode.value.appendNode(sectionsNode);
row.appendNode(menuNode);

var drinksNode = new MappingNode("drinks");
var nonAlcoholicNode = new ListNode("nonAlcoholic", 2);
var tea = nonAlcoholicNode.value.at(0);
tea.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Thai Iced Tea"));
tea.appendNode(new ScalarNode("price", 5.50));
var teaDietary = new ListNode("dietary", 1);
teaDietary.value = Sequence{"V"};
tea.appendNode(teaDietary);
var lemonade = nonAlcoholicNode.value.at(1);
lemonade.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Pandan Lemonade"));
lemonade.appendNode(new ScalarNode("price", 5.00));
var lemonadeDietary = new ListNode("dietary", 2);
lemonadeDietary.value = Sequence{"VG", "GF"};
lemonade.appendNode(lemonadeDietary);
drinksNode.value.appendNode(nonAlcoholicNode);
var wineNode = new MappingNode("wine");
var byGlassNode = new ListNode("byGlass", 1);
var glassWine = byGlassNode.value.at(0);
glassWine.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Picpoul de Pinet, Domaine de Thau 2022"));
glassWine.appendNode(new ScalarNode("style", "white_dry"));
glassWine.appendNode(new ScalarNode("region", "Languedoc, France"));
glassWine.appendNode(new ScalarNode("glass", 9.50));
glassWine.appendNode(new ScalarNode("bottle", 38.00));
wineNode.value.appendNode(byGlassNode);
var byBottleNode = new ListNode("byBottle", 1);
var bottleWine = byBottleNode.value.at(0);
bottleWine.appendNode(new ScalarNode("name", "Cloudy Bay Sauvignon Blanc 2023"));
bottleWine.appendNode(new ScalarNode("style", "white_dry"));
bottleWine.appendNode(new ScalarNode("region", "Marlborough, New Zealand"));
bottleWine.appendNode(new ScalarNode("bottle", 62.00));
wineNode.value.appendNode(byBottleNode);
drinksNode.value.appendNode(wineNode);
row.appendNode(drinksNode);```
